+              <t indent="0" pn="section-18.35.4-7.6-4">Since the record has been confirmed, the client must have
+received the server's reply from the initial EXCHANGE_ID
+request.  The server allows the update, and the client record
+is left intact.</t>
+            </li>
+            <li pn="section-18.35.4-7.7">
+              <t indent="0" pn="section-18.35.4-7.7-1">Update but No Confirmed Record</t>
+              <t indent="0" pn="section-18.35.4-7.7-2">If EXCHGID4_FLAG_UPD_CONFIRMED_REC_A is set, and the server
