+server returns NFS4ERR_NOENT and leaves any unconfirmed record
+intact.</t>
+            </li>
+            <li pn="section-18.35.4-7.8">
+              <t indent="0" pn="section-18.35.4-7.8-1">Update but Wrong Verifier</t>
+              <t indent="0" pn="section-18.35.4-7.8-2">If EXCHGID4_FLAG_UPD_CONFIRMED_REC_A is set, and the server
