+illegal attempt at an update, perhaps because of a retry from
+a previous client incarnation.</t>
+              <artwork align="left" pn="section-18.35.4-7.8-3">{ ownerid_arg, old_verifier_arg, *, clientid_ret, confirmed }</artwork>
+              <t indent="0" pn="section-18.35.4-7.8-4">The server returns NFS4ERR_NOT_SAME and leaves the client
+record intact.</t>
+            </li>
+            <li pn="section-18.35.4-7.9">
+              <t indent="0" pn="section-18.35.4-7.9-1">Update but Wrong Principal</t>
+              <t indent="0" pn="section-18.35.4-7.9-2">If EXCHGID4_FLAG_UPD_CONFIRMED_REC_A is set, and the server
+has the following confirmed record, then this request is an
+illegal attempt at an update by an unauthorized principal.</t>
+              <artwork align="left" pn="section-18.35.4-7.9-3">{ ownerid_arg, verifier_arg, old_principal_arg, clientid_ret,
+confirmed }</artwork>
+              <t indent="0" pn="section-18.35.4-7.9-4">The server returns NFS4ERR_PERM and leaves the client record
+intact.</t>
+            </li>
+          </ol>
         </section>
       </section>
