-stateid, which is set by OPEN (see Section 16.2.3.1.2).  A client may
+stateid, which is set by OPEN (see <xref target="section-16.2.3.1.2" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="Section 16.2.3.1.2"/>).  A client may
